  "body": [
    "The world's trade system exploits farmers. Fairtrade steps in the right direction by supporting sustainable lives for farmers and their families.",
    "Join us, as we ask Walmart to carry Fairtrade bananas.",
    "What happens when communities lead? Frontier Co-op's Alicia Simmons reflects on the cooperative model at work in Madagascar.",
    "+37,000 products sold with the Fairtrade Mark in more than 140 countries",
    "2M+ farmers and workers are involved in Fairtrade worldwide",
    "$2+ Billion in Fairtrade premium paid to farmers in the last decade",
    "Sustainable consumption and production has become the expectation rather than the exception. Fairtrade offers solutions for companies and producers to put fairness at the heart of their operations.",
    "Affoué Angèle Kouassi has farmed cocoa on her own land for 14 years. She participated in Fairtrade’s Women’s School of Leadership in 2021.",
    "Do you want to know the basics? Do you want to know the basics? Our \"What is Fairtrade?\" section covers what we do and why we do it. You can watch a short video about us, learn how many Fairtrade organizations are there, and what areas are critical to our work. What is Fairtrade?",
    "Do you want to dive deep into how Fairtrade works? Do you want to dive deep into how Fairtrade works? Our \"How we work\" section covers the Fairtrade standards that are available, our different types of labels and a detailed list of our projects and programmes across the world. Read more",
    "Do you want to become Fairtrade certfied? Do you want to become Fairtrade certfied? The first step is to get in touch with our team who can walk you through the process of Fairtrade certification and licensing. Get started"
  ],
